<?xml version="1.0"?><quiz type="textAnswer" id="1250" lang="E" hascredits="0"><question><text>&lt;html&gt;What sat down beside Little Miss Muffet (and frightened her away)?&lt;/html&gt;</text><image/><imagerefid/><audio/><audiorefid/></question><answers><answer>spider</answer></answers><reward><text>&lt;html&gt;Spider.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Miss Muffet didn’t need to be scared. Spiders don’t often attack people unless they feel threatened. If they do bite, the wound is rarely serious.
&lt;/html&gt;</text><image/><imagerefid/><audio/><audiorefid/></reward><credits/><rewardcredits/></quiz>